    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7194ec9d82235bca",
      "translationZh": "距离 SupraLabs 上一个模型发布已经过去好一阵子了——不过，今天我们给大家带来了一个特别的东西：Supra2-IMG",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cc8060080f13088",
      "translationZh": "这是一个拥有 100M 参数的 DiT 文生图模型，在 Runpod 上使用单张 H100，在不到 10 小时内完全从零开始训练而成。它能够生成分辨率为 256x256 像素、质量达到最先进水平的图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5bb3683c96be3b2",
      "translationZh": "这些样例绝不是精挑细选出来的！采样设置：seed 0，steps 50，cfg 3.0；每张图像都使用相同的设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3dba8159557ebc4e",
      "translationZh": "如果这里有人对提示词感兴趣，我可以把它们分享给你们！欢迎随时来问！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6febf14f800e880",
      "translationZh": "你也可以在自己的硬件上本地运行这个模型（在 CPU 上生成一张图像约需 20 秒（🤩），在 GPU 上约需 2 秒）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b13fc83cfd12e866",
      "translationZh": "然后，你可以通过运行以下命令来生成图像：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4fef2d50b7af683",
      "translationZh": "模型在 HF 上的链接：https://huggingface.co/SupraLabs/Supra2-IMG",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52f436ee57147175",
      "translationZh": "如果愿意，欢迎在 HF 上给我们点个赞并关注我们 🤗 ❤️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4ef1d4b82313fba",
      "translationZh": "各位，欢迎任何反馈！有任何问题都可以随时提问！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
